<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronics/Imaging upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronics/Imaging upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Alex Henderson upgraded Electronics for Imaging Inc to buy from hold, according to his office.  </p>
<p>-- Henderson said that after visit to company on Tuesday &quot;it became apparent the company is firing on all cylinders.&quot;</p>
<p>-- expects company to beat his third quarter earnings estimate of $0.55 versus $0.36 last year. Analysts estimated $0.51-$0.55, he said.</p>
<p>-- said the European business is rebounding, and Japanese business is gaining significant market share.  Sees revenues from Japanese business rising 100 percent.</p>
<p>-- raised the price target to $90 from $80 for 12 to 18 months.</p>
</text>
